{
  "source": "Prompts/what-is-ai-v12.mp4",
  "duration": 152.4053125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.82,
      "text": "You need to start your next history project, but you haven't picked a topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.52,
      "end": 6.12,
      "text": "You look around the room for inspiration."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.88,
      "end": 10.48,
      "text": "Ask your desk, give me 10 ideas for my next history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.38,
      "end": 12.98,
      "text": "Nothing. It's a desk."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.86,
      "end": 16.26,
      "text": "Ask a friend, and they can help you brainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 20.32,
      "text": "Ask AI, and it can give you a list in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.2,
      "end": 24.74,
      "text": "AI is software built to do things that used to take a human brain."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.48,
      "end": 28.5,
      "text": "It can understand a question, summarize a long document,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 30.18,
      "text": "or translate a conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.24,
      "end": 33.36,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it actually thinks like your friend,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.88,
      "end": 36.44,
      "text": "or that all 10 of those history ideas will be good."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.24,
      "end": 39.82,
      "text": "You simply have a tool that can help with cognitive tasks"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.82,
      "end": 41.82,
      "text": "that once required a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.4,
      "end": 44.92,
      "text": "AI left the realm of science fiction years ago"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.92,
      "end": 46.54,
      "text": "to become part of your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.24,
      "end": 48.72,
      "text": "It operates the apps on your phone"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.72,
      "end": 51.94,
      "text": "and powers the tools your first job will hand you on day one."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.54,
      "end": 55.36,
      "text": "Most of what it does today, it will do better tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.1,
      "end": 60.76,
      "text": "This graphic shows a breakdown of exactly where AI already lives"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.76,
      "end": 61.58,
      "text": "in your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.38,
      "end": 65.62,
      "text": "First, it recommends media by predicting what you might like next."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.18,
      "end": 69.02,
      "text": "You interact with this on Spotify, Netflix, and TikTok."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.8,
      "end": 73.66,
      "text": "Second, navigation tools predict traffic and your arrival time"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.66,
      "end": 75.46,
      "text": "on apps like Google Maps and Waze."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.76,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "Third, face recognition validates your identity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.0,
      "end": 81.52,
      "text": "checking whether a face matches you for phone unlocks"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.52,
      "end": 82.5,
      "text": "and photo tagging."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.3,
      "end": 86.36,
      "text": "Fourth, voice assistants turn your speech into words"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.36,
      "end": 88.86,
      "text": "when you talk to Siri, Alexa, or Hey Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.6,
      "end": 93.06,
      "text": "Finally, chatbots carry on direct conversations with you"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.06,
      "end": 96.12,
      "text": "through programs like Chat GPT, Cloud, and Gemini."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.54,
      "end": 99.92,
      "text": "Looking at this complete picture shows us something clear."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.8,
      "end": 103.54,
      "text": "AI was already part of your day before chatbots arrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.72,
      "end": 106.2,
      "text": "Different AI systems do different jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.94,
      "end": 108.7,
      "text": "Let's look at two kinds you already use."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.7,
      "end": 112.24,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down these tools into two main categories."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.24,
      "end": 115.0,
      "text": "First, is recommendation AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.02,
      "end": 118.04,
      "text": "Its job is to choose from what already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.82,
      "end": 120.8,
      "text": "It works by ranking the available options"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.8,
      "end": 123.48,
      "text": "and selecting the likely best match for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.22,
      "end": 126.84,
      "text": "You see this every day when you get a suggested Netflix show,"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.44,
      "end": 129.2,
      "text": "a Spotify song, or a maps route."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.3,
      "end": 131.56,
      "text": "Then there is generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.56,
      "end": 134.3,
      "text": "Its job is to make something that didn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.22,
      "end": 138.26,
      "text": "A prompt is simply the question or set of instructions you give it."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.26,
      "end": 142.72,
      "text": "This can result in a brand new email, an essay, an image,"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.0,
      "end": 145.28,
      "text": "a website, a song, or a video."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.5,
      "end": 148.86,
      "text": "AI can recommend AI can create."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.78,
      "end": 151.56,
      "text": "This course focuses on generative AI."
    }
  ],
